(text "INTEGRATION\nI2C 0x40: A0 and A1 to GND; INA219_SHUNT_OHM = 0.1 in sketch.ino.\nJP1 normally open: bridge only when local I2C pullups are needed. I2C lines at 3.3V.\nInput/load negatives and Arduino GND share the same reference.\nAt 2A: shunt drop 0.2V; shunt dissipation 0.4W. Use 0.1R, 1%, >=1W, 2512." (at 16 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid b8697515-f339-4e5a-bd86-c3f6c4fe6b8a))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
